r.push(A.at(A.f3(A.R(A.a([A.x(i,A.R(A.a([B.akK,B.M,A.q("Effective Date: 13 June 2025  |  Version 2.0",i,i,i,i,A.a0(i,i,B.f.J(0.7),i,i,i,i,i,i,i,i,11,i,i,i,i,i,!0,i,i,i,i,i,i,i,i),i,i),B.E,A.q('This Privacy Policy governs how Agent Platform ("Agent", "we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, stores, and protects your personal data. It is designed in compliance with the Nigeria Data Protection Regulation (NDPR) 2019, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) 2018 (EU/EEA users), the Apple App Store Guidelines, and the Google Play Store Developer Programme Policies.',i,i,i,i,A.a0(i,i,B.f.J(0.85),i,i,i,i,i,i,i,i,12,i,i,i,i,1.6,!0,i,i,i,i,i,i,i,i),i,i)],s),B.r,B.h,B.d,B.k),B.e,i,i,new A.E(i,i,i,q,i,B.k4,B.m),i,i,i,i,B.H,i,i,1/0),B.aq,j.lK("Agent Platform is the Data Controller responsible for your personal data.\n\nData Protection Officer (DPO):\nEmail: dpo@agentplatform.ng\nAddress: Lagos, Nigeria\n\nFor EU/EEA residents, Agent Platform processes your data under Article 6 of the GDPR. Our lawful bases for processing include: your consent, performance of a contract, legal obligation, and our legitimate interests.",B.qO,"1. Data Controller"),j.lK("We collect the following categories of data to provide and improve our services:\n\n\ud83d\udd35 Identity Data\n\u2022 Full name, date of birth\n\u2022 Government-issued ID (NIN, Passport, Driver's Licence front and back)\n\u2022 Selfie / facial image for liveness verification\n\n\ud83d\udd35 Contact & Account Data\n\u2022 Email address, phone number\n\u2022 Account role (tenant or landlord)\n\u2022 Profile photo (optional)\n\n\ud83d\udd35 Financial Data\n\u2022 Wallet balance and transaction history\n\u2022 Escrow transaction records\n\u2022 Payment method type (card, bank, USSD \u2014 processed by Flutterwave, not stored by us)\n\u2022 Bank Verification Number (BVN) \u2014 required for KYC compliance\n\n\ud83d\udd35 Property Data\n\u2022 Property listings you create, including photos, videos, and descriptions\n\u2022 Property ownership documents (for landlord KYC)\n\u2022 Tenancy agreements and digital signatures\n\n\ud83d\udd35 Behavioural & Device Data\n\u2022 Login events (login, logout, method used)\n\u2022 Property views, saves, and enquiries\n\u2022 Search queries and filter preferences\n\u2022 Device model, OS version, app version\n\u2022 IP address and approximate location\n\n\ud83d\udd35 Biometric Data\n\u2022 Fingerprint / Face ID credentials used for biometric login\n\u2022 Note: Biometric data is stored ONLY on your device using the platform's secure storage. It is never uploaded to our servers.",B.zw,"2. Data We Collect"),j.lK("We collect your data for the following purposes:\n\n\u2705 Account creation and authentication\n\u2705 Identity verification (KYC) to prevent fraud\n\u2705 Processing rent payments and escrow transactions\n\u2705 Generating tenancy agreements\n\u2705 Sending transaction confirmations and notifications\n\u2705 Improving platform performance and user experience\n\u2705 Complying with Nigerian law, NDPR, EFCC, and FIRS requirements\n\u2705 Preventing money laundering and fraudulent activity\n\u2705 Responding to customer support inquiries\n\u2705 Providing relevant property recommendations (non-advertising)\n\nWe DO NOT sell your personal data to third parties for advertising or marketing purposes.",B.a_J,"3. Why We Collect Your Data"),j.lK("We share your data only when necessary, and only with trusted parties:\n\n\u2022 Firebase (Google) \u2014 Authentication, Firestore database, and cloud storage. Data centres may be located outside Nigeria. Google complies with GDPR Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs).\n\n\u2022 Flutterwave \u2014 Payment processing. Only your email and amount are shared; full card or bank details never pass through our servers.\n\n\u2022 Google Maps / Places API \u2014 Property location display. No personally identifiable data is shared.\n\n\u2022 Regulatory Authorities \u2014 We may share data with NITDA, EFCC, or law enforcement if legally required.\n\nAll third-party partners are contractually bound to protect your data and use it only for the specified purpose.",B.a_G,"4. Who We Share Your Data With"),j.lK("We retain your data for the following periods:\n\n\u2022 Account data: For the duration of your account + 7 years after closure (legal record-keeping)\n\u2022 KYC documents: 7 years from date of submission (NDPR and AML compliance)\n\u2022 Transaction records: 7 years (FIRS and tax compliance)\n\u2022 Tenancy agreements: 7 years from agreement expiry\n\u2022 Behavioural logs: 12 months rolling\n\u2022 Device & session data: 90 days\n\nAfter the retention period, data is securely deleted or anonymised.",B.a_C,"5. Data Retention"),j.lK("We implement industry-standard security measures:\n\n\ud83d\udd12 TLS/SSL encryption for all data in transit\n\ud83d\udd12 AES-256 encryption for data at rest in Firebase\n\ud83d\udd12 Biometric credentials stored in device Secure Enclave only\n\ud83d\udd12 Firebase Security Rules to restrict data access\n\ud83d\udd12 Role-based access control (tenant, landlord, admin)\n\ud83d\udd12 Regular security audits and penetration testing\n\ud83d\udd12 Admin access logged and monitored\n\nDespite our best efforts, no system is 100% secure. In the event of a data breach, we will notify affected users and NITDA within 72 hours as required by NDPR.",B.a_t,"6. How We Protect Your Data"),j.lK("Under the NDPR and GDPR, you have the following rights:\n\n\u2022 Right to Access \u2014 Request a copy of all data we hold about you.\n\u2022 Right to Correction \u2014 Request correction of inaccurate data.\n\u2022 Right to Deletion \u2014 Request deletion of your account and data (subject to legal retention requirements).\n\u2022 Right to Portability \u2014 Receive your data in a machine-readable format.\n\u2022 Right to Object \u2014 Object to processing based on legitimate interests.\n\u2022 Right to Restrict Processing \u2014 Request we pause processing under certain conditions.\n\u2022 Right to Withdraw Consent \u2014 Withdraw consent at any time; this will not affect prior lawful processing.\n\nTo exercise any of these rights, contact us at: dpo@agentplatform.ng\nWe will respond within 30 days as required by NDPR.",B.ip,"7. Your Rights (NDPR & GDPR)"),j.lK("Agent Platform is NOT intended for use by persons under the age of 18.\n\nWe do not knowingly collect personal data from minors. If you believe a child has provided us with data, please contact dpo@agentplatform.ng immediately and we will delete it within 72 hours.",B.a_h,"8. Children's Privacy (COPPA / NDPR)"),j.lK("Our mobile application does not use browser cookies. However, we use the following:\n\n\u2022 Firebase Analytics \u2014 anonymised usage statistics (opt-out available in Settings)\n\u2022 Firebase Crashlytics \u2014 crash reporting to improve stability\n\u2022 SharedPreferences \u2014 local storage for your in-app preferences (tour status, theme, etc.)\n\nNo tracking pixels, ad networks, or cross-app tracking SDKs are used.",B.a0t,"9. Cookies & Tracking"),j.lK("Your data may be transferred to and stored in countries outside Nigeria (including the United States and EU member states) due to our use of Firebase (Google Cloud).\n\nAll such transfers are conducted under adequate safeguards including GDPR Standard Contractual Clauses and Google's Cloud Data Processing Addendum.\n\nFor EU/EEA users: You have the right to lodge a complaint with your local Data Protection Authority if you believe your rights have been violated.",B.a_z,"10. International Transfers"),j.lK("We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes via:\n\u2022 In-app notification\n\u2022 Email to your registered address\n\nContinued use of Agent Platform after notification constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.\n\nCurrent version: 2.0\nEffective: 13 June 2025",B.a_K,"11. Policy Updates"),j.lK("For privacy inquiries, data requests, or complaints:\n\n\ud83d\udce7 DPO Email: admin@agentmobiletech.com\n\ud83d\udce7 Support: customercare@agentmobiletech.com\n\ud83c\udfe2 Agent Platform Ltd, Lagos, Nigeria\n\nIf you are dissatisfied with our response, you may lodge a complaint with the National Information Technology Development Agency (NITDA) \u2014 Nigeria's data protection authority \u2014 at www.nitda.gov.ng.",B.a_j,"12. Contact Us"),B.S],s),B.r,B.h,B.d,B.k),j.w,B.w,B.YF,i,B.C),1))
